# L §4.4 "A window of one day is that day" (tally 2.3, #247; the review of G3, N6 (ii)): `w1 =
# window(2026-06-01, 2026-06-01)` read by `as known`, an ask's `law` and `bal(x, d)` is 2026-06-01, as on the
# engine. Before: HOLE-IMPRECISE for each.
=== m.tally
model forms
  tally 2
  on 2026-08-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
source s "invented"
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place spar: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place third: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place one: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input pay: money PLN
input a: date
input b: date
input told: date
input late: date
input w: date
input w1: date
input w2: date
input wd: date
input hol: calendar
input rate[d in days]: num
input mrate[m in months]: num
input lawd: date
input lrate: num
def gift: date
  rule base = window(told, late)
def cp: date = w
def sh: date = add_days(w, n_3)
def one_c: date = window(a, a)
def back: date = window(b, a)
def lr: num = lrate at w
move salary: transfers
  on window(a, b)
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay
move bonus: transfers
  on gift
  leg cash from world to spar amount pay
move lawm: transfers
  on a
  at window(a, b)
  leg cash from world to third amount pay
move oneday: transfers
  on w1
  leg cash from world to one amount pay
input n_3: int
input d_20260331: date
input d_20260312: date
input d_20260430: date
input d_20260412: date
input d_20260410: date
input d_20260413: date
input d_20260420: date
input n_1: int
input d_20260506: date
input d_20260509: date
input d_20261231: date
input d_20200101: date
input d_20260630: date
input m_202605: month
input n_5: int
input d_20260302: date
input n_m1: int
input d_20260101: date
input d_20260505: date
input d_20260520: date
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 1 000.00 PLN "c"
  a = 2026-03-10 "c"
  b = 2026-03-12 "c"
  told = 2026-04-10 "c"
  late = 2026-04-13 "c"
  w = window(2026-05-04, 2026-05-08) "c"
  w1 = window(2026-06-01, 2026-06-01) "c"
  w2 = window(2026-05-06, 2026-05-20) "c"
  wd = 2026-06-01 "c"
  rate[*] = 2 "c"
  mrate[*] = 3 "c"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[spar] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[third] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
  opening[one] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "c"
version calv
  cite s
  governs 2026
  known 2026-01-01
  hol = calendar(weekends [sat, sun], added [2026-05-05, ?"which day is the spring holiday?"]) governs 2026-04..2026-12 "c"
  hol = calendar(weekends [sat, sun], added [2026-01-06]) governs 2026-01..2026-03 "c"
version vl
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  lawd = 2026-01-01 "c"
version la
  cite s
  governs ..2026-05-05
  known 2026-01-01
  lrate = 1 "c"
version lb
  cite s
  governs 2026-05-06..
  known 2026-01-01
  lrate = 2 "c"
version autov
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  n_3 = 3 "c"
  d_20260331 = 2026-03-31 "c"
  d_20260312 = 2026-03-12 "c"
  d_20260430 = 2026-04-30 "c"
  d_20260412 = 2026-04-12 "c"
  d_20260410 = 2026-04-10 "c"
  d_20260413 = 2026-04-13 "c"
  d_20260420 = 2026-04-20 "c"
  n_1 = 1 "c"
  d_20260506 = 2026-05-06 "c"
  d_20260509 = 2026-05-09 "c"
  d_20261231 = 2026-12-31 "c"
  d_20200101 = 2020-01-01 "c"
  d_20260630 = 2026-06-30 "c"
  m_202605 = 2026-05 "c"
  n_5 = 5 "c"
  d_20260302 = 2026-03-02 "c"
  n_m1 = -1 "c"
  d_20260101 = 2026-01-01 "c"
  d_20260505 = 2026-05-05 "c"
  d_20260520 = 2026-05-20 "c"
ask q56: bal(one, w1)
ask law2: lrate law w1
ask kn: gift as known w1
=== expect
kn: window(2026-04-10, 2026-04-13)
  cut 2026-06-01
law2: 2
  law date 2026-06-01, cut 2026-08-01
q56: ?"date within window(2026-03-10, 2026-03-12) not precise enough for the law date of lawm"
  unknown day: window(2026-03-10, 2026-03-12)
  unfulfilled: oneday
  cut 2026-08-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD def back is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def cp is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def lr is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def one_c is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD def sh is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20200101 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260101 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260302 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260312 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260331 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260410 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260412 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260413 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260420 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260430 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260505 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260506 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260509 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260520 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20260630 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input d_20261231 is read by nothing
warning: WARN-UNREAD input hol is read by nothing
